<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Komercni czk 5.4bln cons '96 net.</title>
<headline>Czech Komercni czk 5.4bln cons '96 net.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The largest Czech commercial bank Komercni Banka a.s. said on Tuesday it had posted consolidated 1996 net profits of 5.4 billion crowns ($176.5 million) versus 5.3 billion in 1995, according to international accounting standards.</p>
<p>($ = 30.59 Czech Crowns)</p>
</text>
